# Techwave Delivery Intelligence -- frontend env
#
# There is intentionally no VITE_PROJECT_ID / VITE_SPRINT_ID / demo-data
# flag here. The app has no hardcoded or demo project -- it always starts
# from the real `GET /projects` call (see src/api/queries.ts::useProjects,
# src/App.tsx) and lets the tenant pick from their actually-connected
# projects, or shows the "connect a project" first-run state if they have
# none. See docs/technical/scrum-16-dashboard.html §3 for the removed
# env-var-driven single-project mode this replaced.

# Optional: override the backend origin the Vite dev proxy forwards
# /api/* to (see vite.config.ts). Defaults to http://localhost:8000.
# VITE_BACKEND_ORIGIN=http://localhost:8000
